{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fractured Rift is a <strong><i>team building</i></strong><i>, <strong>turn-based, auto battler rogue lite</strong></i> where strategy and customization are key. When a mysterious rift to another world tears open, you gather a team of skilled warriors or mages and set out to explore its shifting depths.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Choose your team</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, <i><strong>recruit new units, unlock new skills</strong></i>, and shape each unit with unique talents, equipment, and skills to fit your tactical vision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581670/extras/6e0f971efea0e931d6e4f0820ddcdfa9.poster.avif?t=1771462637\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581670/extras/6e0f971efea0e931d6e4f0820ddcdfa9.webm?t=1771462637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581670/extras/6e0f971efea0e931d6e4f0820ddcdfa9.mp4?t=1771462637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Auto Battler or Manuel</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command each move <i><strong>manually</strong></i> for full control, or let the game handle actions in <i><strong>auto</strong></i> battle mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581670/extras/e736a3e1aada8026abd710760c46107f.poster.avif?t=1771462637\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581670/extras/e736a3e1aada8026abd710760c46107f.webm?t=1771462637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581670/extras/e736a3e1aada8026abd710760c46107f.mp4?t=1771462637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Skill Modification</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can obtain skill runes to modify skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581670/extras/f9ec1db189d44f992e8fe7b21996cff1.poster.avif?t=1771462637\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581670/extras/f9ec1db189d44f992e8fe7b21996cff1.webm?t=1771462637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581670/extras/f9ec1db189d44f992e8fe7b21996cff1.mp4?t=1771462637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Reward</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each floor, you\u2019ll earn <strong>shards</strong>, a currency used to purchase powerful rewards in the shop, like stat-enhancing potions, crafting materials,\u00a0 buffs, or rare skill scrolls. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581670/extras/dcac02b085624e7df687926ffa486538.poster.avif?t=1771462637\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581670/extras/dcac02b085624e7df687926ffa486538.webm?t=1771462637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581670/extras/dcac02b085624e7df687926ffa486538.mp4?t=1771462637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Customizable Game Mode</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offer different game modes and even allow custom ones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581670/extras/9cc76f48e896c08ffaa5c9532f13048f.poster.avif?t=1771462637\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581670/extras/9cc76f48e896c08ffaa5c9532f13048f.webm?t=1771462637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581670/extras/9cc76f48e896c08ffaa5c9532f13048f.mp4?t=1771462637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you prefer full control or a more automated approach, the game lets you manually command your team or let them act on their own in auto battle mode. With every floor procedurally generated, every run offers new challenges and tough decisions.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Into the RIft","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3581670/eabf80d34134521f347c5554da06dc83542c3e4b.jpg"},{"name":"The Beginning","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3581670/272f2b447b588fe20c3b7c68e19d7eeecb7e5ecf.jpg"},{"name":"Boss Slayer I","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3581670/6bb5da7b651b27c664840379c531f3cef982bbc8.jpg"},{"name":"Boss Slayer II","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3581670/b2b001df0150ffc4d5cde2f1280a0bb6d02a1c99.jpg"},{"name":"Boss Slayer III","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3581670/f20f8de1a64dcf9c16ec0509032a7c13e93e6d90.jpg"},{"name":"Reward","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3581670/b66ffa090cbd25d2058e42c90b1784260254a63d.jpg"},{"name":"First Blood","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3581670/eff068d25f071d7f47a419b41a6c0b4b71a6825d.jpg"},{"name":"Massacre","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3581670/d45a3140198c822af12b8fee7a280ebb57977196.jpg"},{"name":"Carnage","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3581670/6b0222ebd4e27eeb9694b9165b31d80b47fc6c9b.jpg"},{"name":"Crafting Apprentice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3581670/af4d8fa9dd6dcd730282afb8ea290afb6dbea3a0.jpg"}],"total":56},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3581670?t=1771462637","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581670/c46cde6a01198eb8999d33d6c4cc008db99cda3b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771462637","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581670/7f8de0c12847e29c954d588fd896746d1234aaec/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771462637","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581670/7f8de0c12847e29c954d588fd896746d1234aaec/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771462637","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4030050,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fractured Rift is a <strong><i>team building</i></strong><i>, <strong>turn-based, auto battler rogue lite</strong></i> where strategy and customization are key. When a mysterious rift to another world tears open, you gather a team of skilled warriors or mages and set out to explore its shifting depths.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Choose your team</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, <i><strong>recruit new units, unlock new skills</strong></i>, and shape each unit with unique talents, equipment, and skills to fit your tactical vision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581670/extras/6e0f971efea0e931d6e4f0820ddcdfa9.poster.avif?t=1771462637\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581670/extras/6e0f971efea0e931d6e4f0820ddcdfa9.webm?t=1771462637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581670/extras/6e0f971efea0e931d6e4f0820ddcdfa9.mp4?t=1771462637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Auto Battler or Manuel</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command each move <i><strong>manually</strong></i> for full control, or let the game handle actions in <i><strong>auto</strong></i> battle mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581670/extras/e736a3e1aada8026abd710760c46107f.poster.avif?t=1771462637\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581670/extras/e736a3e1aada8026abd710760c46107f.webm?t=1771462637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581670/extras/e736a3e1aada8026abd710760c46107f.mp4?t=1771462637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Skill Modification</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can obtain skill runes to modify skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581670/extras/f9ec1db189d44f992e8fe7b21996cff1.poster.avif?t=1771462637\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581670/extras/f9ec1db189d44f992e8fe7b21996cff1.webm?t=1771462637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581670/extras/f9ec1db189d44f992e8fe7b21996cff1.mp4?t=1771462637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Reward</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each floor, you\u2019ll earn <strong>shards</strong>, a currency used to purchase powerful rewards in the shop, like stat-enhancing potions, crafting materials,\u00a0 buffs, or rare skill scrolls. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581670/extras/dcac02b085624e7df687926ffa486538.poster.avif?t=1771462637\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581670/extras/dcac02b085624e7df687926ffa486538.webm?t=1771462637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581670/extras/dcac02b085624e7df687926ffa486538.mp4?t=1771462637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Customizable Game Mode</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offer different game modes and even allow custom ones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsi